  "fidelityReview": {
    "target": "medium-fi",
    "status": "passed",
    "inputHash": "sha256:fb22d0cd48314084175aea28dd98b2eaf59d94c4bef2bfc999ef63e90ee62d55",
    "notes": "Kokushkin Bridge has a low green panel girder, wreath railings and granite abutments. Original geometry reproduces the circles, lozenges, clearance plaque and diamond from the ordinary references. The canal level and street grade are visualization elevations. The procedural walkway still meets the model with a 16.7 cm curb at the sampled bank connection. Procedural sidewalk edges overlap the landings in places, and streets outside the fitted area still show abrupt terrain slopes. The curved quay wings, ironwork and marker are exterior approximations."
  },
